    "paragraph": "Evaluated across varied data-sharing levels and CAV fleet sizes, three traffic management center configurations for speed harmonization in urban networks were tested using multi-agent reinforcement learning with validation in Hamburg. Thematic analysis of 132 interviews conducted between 2020 and 2024 evaluated how socio-environmental valuation methods function across three power dimensions in UK urban planning. Using Landsat imagery from 2004 to 2024, remote sensing analysis measured land use changes and surface temperatures in Cuttack, India, where built-up areas expanded by 50.52%.",
